---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import WaitlistForm from '../components/WaitlistForm.astro';
---
<Layout title="Get Fable product updates" description="Follow Fable, the local-first AI workspace built open by design.">
  <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 2rem auto;">
    <h1>Get Fable product updates</h1>

    <p>Follow Fable as the local-first AI workspace opens up across providers, connectors, memory, schedules, and approvals.</p>

    <div class="honest-box">
      <strong>Onboarding & Privacy:</strong>
      Fable's core desktop workspace runs locally without a hosted account. Product update data is stored separately from OAuth connector credentials.
    </div>

    <WaitlistForm />
  </div>
</Layout>
